                 what's behind).
 05BA   00B8    SUB SlotScreen (fontData() AS INTEGER, mvint AS INTEGER, msen A
                S SINGLE, mode AS INTEGER, dead AS INTEGER, act AS INTEGER)
 05C5   00B8            DIM mr AS RegType, mo AS RegType
